> quo x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1
quo x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1
  = x^3 + x
  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> rem x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1
rem x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1
  = x - 1
  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> divide x^5 - 1 by x^2 - 1
  ucas: divide x^5 - 1 by x^2 - 1
divide x^5 - 1, x^2 - 1
  quotient x^3 + x, remainder x - 1
  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> expand (x^2 - 1)*(x^3 + x) + (x - 1)
  ucas: expand (x^2 - 1)*(x^3 + x) + (x - 1)
expand (x^2 - 1)*(x^3 + x) + (x - 1)
  = x^5 - 1
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> divide x^3 - 1 by x - 1
  ucas: divide x^3 - 1 by x - 1
divide x^3 - 1, x - 1
  quotient x^2 + x + 1, remainder 0
  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 1)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> divide x^2 + 1 by x - 1
  ucas: divide x^2 + 1 by x - 1
divide x^2 + 1, x - 1
  quotient x + 1, remainder 2
  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 1)
  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)
> quo 6x^4 - 4x^3 + 5x^2 - 2x + 1, 3x^2 - x + 1
quo 6x^4 - 4x^3 + 5x^2 - 2x + 1, 3x^2 - x + 1
  = 2x^2 - 2x/3 + 0.7777777778
  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)
  check: equal at 64 sample points (max relative difference 5.3e-16)
> rem 6x^4 - 4x^3 + 5x^2 - 2x + 1, 3x^2 - x + 1
rem 6x^4 - 4x^3 + 5x^2 - 2x + 1, 3x^2 - x + 1
  = 0.2222222222 - 5x/9
  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 2)
  check: equal at 64 sample points (max relative difference 5.3e-16)
